{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99804","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99804/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99804/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99804/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99804","id":2702917212,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6hGz5c","number":99804,"title":"EXR Loses Alpha in VRAM Compressed","user":{"login":"ettiSurreal","id":98223724,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdrGbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98223724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal","html_url":"https://github.com/ettiSurreal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-11-28T18:12:19Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T19:55:23Z","closed_at":"2024-11-28T19:31:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: v4.4.dev5.official [9e6098432], v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev5 - Windows 10.0.26100 - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-11400F @ 2.60GHz (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI am working on a prototype that utilizes EXR images for the graphics in 3D, however I ran into an issue that when compression mode is set to VRAM Compressed, the texture loses its alpha channel.\nThis is a huge issue on my end because making every texture lossless inflates the file size of the game by ~15x. In my case I could probably switch to using separate images for the alpha channel, but since I couldn't find this documented anywhere I assumed this is a bug.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e7c4a67-6a1e-4eb9-a013-0d11cab38c65)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2862c0a5-d545-4b07-b975-0522f972b18f)\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nImport an EXR image that has transparency, and set the compression mode to VRAM Compressed.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[alphacompression.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17951294/alphacompression.zip)\n","closed_by":{"login":"ettiSurreal","id":98223724,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdrGbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98223724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal","html_url":"https://github.com/ettiSurreal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99804/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}